  <h2>Our purpose</h2>
  <p>Karinderya Wiki is an English-language, community-focused reference for players of the Karinderya Roblox experience. This first edition provides a clear structure for guides, food, recipes, workers, equipment, codes, and updates.</p>
  <h2>Built for players</h2>
  <p>The wiki focuses on practical game information: what an item or system does, where it fits, and how players can use it while running their restaurant.</p>
  <h2>Independent project</h2>
  <p>This website is independently operated and is not affiliated with Roblox Corporation or the Karinderya development team.</p>
